{
  "$description": "Per-app geometry and metadata for every webview UI. Read by all three hosts (macOS ui_builder, Windows WebView_Host_Open, future Linux WebKitGTK host) so geometry is defined once. Entry path convention: _shared/ui/<id>/index.html. Locales base convention: _shared/data/locales/. Note: macOS metrics_typing and metrics_apps use screen-relative sizing (sf.w-100, sf.h-100) rather than fixed dimensions — the values here are recommended defaults for non-macOS hosts.",
